 "reviews": {
  "title": "What Our Customers Say About Us",
  "titlePhone": "What Our Customers Says About Us",
  "badge": {
   "src": "assets/in-pages/img1.webp",
   "alt": "Google Rating"
  },
  "items": [
   {
    "text": "This place is definitely one of the best here in town they have amazing deals a loyalty membership that actually rewards your loyalty and even the cheapest joint there will get you high enough for a while.",
    "name": "Jacob Argue",
    "stars": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "Out of all the dispos in Big Rapids, High society is hands down the best! Very attentive and helpful staff. They also run some pretty killer deals you can’t find other places",
    "name": "Autumn Mckernan",
    "stars": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "Krystal was amazing and super helpful. I will definitely be back, as she had awesome recommendations. Jess did, too. Plus, they were so kind and patient with me. It can be a little overwhelming, but you can bet you're in good hands here. They will ensure you have an awesome experience no matter what!",
    "name": "Brittany",
    "stars": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "Fantastic store, can't say enough good things about them. All of the bud tenders are friendly, knowledgeable, and can provide first-hand knowledge about products. The store is clean and inviting. Plenty of parking places. Their merchandise is displayed and organized to make shopping easier. They also have great deals through the app, be sure to check it out before shopping. I highly recommend shopping here!",
    "name": "Charlotte Minar",
    "stars": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "JP was the best budtender I've had yet at High Society! He was much more approachable and educated us more on what they offer! Highly recommend coming into see him first hand!",
    "name": "Maggie P",
    "stars": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "Stopped in with was a first time customer greeted at the door by one of the friendliest greeters I’ve ever met. Small talk was absolutely amazing! Good atmosphere inside of the store. Manager was very welcoming. As was the sales staff.",
    "name": "David Stillwagon",
    "stars": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "I had a phenomenal experience Going to high Society. Lydia was not only amazing but helped me and a friend find some awesome deals! Recommend anyone who is visiting Mount Pleasant to go to high Society!!!",
    "name": "Dallas Fletcher",
    "stars": 5
   },
   {
    "text": "Great selection, and Lydia did awesome explaining all of the products anytime I asked. Will definitely revisit. Great place!",
    "name": "Daniel Shook",
    "stars": 5
   }
  ]
 },
